-- ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
-- AUTO ROLL LOGIC: NO ROKA MODE (CHECK -> ROLL)
-- ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
local isRolling = false
local rolls = 0

local function UpdateStatus(text, color)
    StatusLbl.Text = text
    StatusLbl.TextColor3 = color or Color3.fromRGB(160, 160, 180)
end

StartBtn.MouseButton1Click:Connect(function()
    if isRolling then return end
    if TargetStand == nil and TargetTrait == nil then
        UpdateStatus("⚠️ Vui lòng chọn Stand hoặc Trait!", Color3.fromRGB(255, 160, 60))
        return
    end

    isRolling = true
    rolls = 0
    
    UpdateStatus("⚡ Đang kiểm tra dữ liệu hiện tại...", Color3.fromRGB(100, 255, 180))

    task.spawn(function()
        local StandValueObj = LocalPlayer:WaitForChild("PlayerData"):WaitForChild("SlotData"):WaitForChild("Stand")
        
        while isRolling do
            local currentData = GetCurrentStandData()
            local currentStandName = currentData and currentData.Name or "None"
            local currentTraitName = currentData and currentData.Trait or "None"
            
            -- Làm sạch khoảng trắng để check
            local gotName = string.match(tostring(currentStandName), "^%s*(.-)%s*$") or "?"
            local gotTrait = string.match(tostring(currentTraitName), "^%s*(.-)%s*$") or "None"

            -- [BƯỚC 1]: CHECK VALUE TRƯỚC (NẾU TRÙNG THÌ DỪNG LUÔN)
            local matchStand = false
            local matchTrait = false

            if TargetStand == nil or gotName == TargetStand then matchStand = true end
            if TargetTrait == nil or gotTrait == TargetTrait then matchTrait = true end

            -- Không cho phép dừng nếu đang có Stand "None" hoặc rỗng (trừ khi cố ý)
            if matchStand and matchTrait and gotName ~= "None" and gotName ~= "" and gotName ~= "?" then
                isRolling = false
                UpdateStatus("✅ Trúng: " .. gotName .. " [" .. gotTrait .. "]", Color3.fromRGB(90, 255, 130))
                task.spawn(function() SendWebhook(gotName, gotTrait, rolls) end)
                break
            end
            
            -- [BƯỚC 2]: NẾU KHÔNG TRÙNG, SỬ DỤNG ARROW LUÔN (KHÔNG CẦN ROKA)
            local currentString = tostring(StandValueObj.Value)
            UpdateStatus("🏹 Đang đâm Arrow...", Color3.fromRGB(100, 255, 100))
            
            rolls = rolls + 1
            local waitTime = 0
            local successChange = false
            
            while isRolling and waitTime < 20 do
                pcall(function() ReplicatedStorage.requests.character.use_item:FireServer("Stand Arrow") end)
                
                local t0 = os.clock()
                while isRolling and (os.clock() - t0 < 0.25) do
                    if tostring(StandValueObj.Value) ~= currentString then
                        successChange = true
                        break
                    end
                    task.wait() 
                end

                if successChange then break end
                waitTime = waitTime + 0.25
            end

            if not isRolling then break end

            if not successChange then
                UpdateStatus("❌ Lỗi mạng hoặc hết item Arrow!", Color3.fromRGB(255, 90, 90))
                isRolling = false
                break
            end

            -- Chờ server update hẳn Name mới
            task.wait(0.5) 

            local newData = GetCurrentStandData()
            local newName = newData and newData.Name or "?"
            local newTrait = newData and newData.Trait or "?"
            
            local cleanNewName = string.match(tostring(newName), "^%s*(.-)%s*$") or "?"
            local cleanNewTrait = string.match(tostring(newTrait), "^%s*(.-)%s*$") or "None"
            
            UpdateStatus(string.format("🎲 #%d: %s [%s]", rolls, cleanNewName, cleanNewTrait), Color3.fromRGB(210, 190, 255))
        end
    end)
end)

StopBtn.MouseButton1Click:Connect(function()
    if isRolling then
        isRolling = false
        UpdateStatus("⏹ Đã dừng. (Rolls: " .. rolls .. ")", Color3.fromRGB(255, 160, 60))
    end
end)

